<title>UK: LME copper dips after stocks rise by 2,675 tonnes.</title>
<headline>LME copper dips after stocks rise by 2,675 tonnes.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Dips towards $2,350 support after stocks rise by 2,675 tonnes. Cash/threes backwardation little changed at $72/$75.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Attacks $1,642 barrier, stocks down 1,625 tonnes.</p>
<p>LEAD - Slightly firmer, but vulnerable.</p>
<p>ZINC - Moderately firmer, stocks fall by 1,025 tonnes.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Back above $7,300. TIN - Quiet, touch firmer.</p>
</text>
